{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/misofoundations\/misowcag21ratio\/requirementsaa"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/MISOFoundations\/documentation\/MISOFoundations\/MISOWCAG21Ratio\/requirementsAA"},"sections":[],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Foundations"}],"role":"symbol","title":"requirementsAA","symbolKind":"property","roleHeading":"Instance Property","externalID":"s:15MISOFoundations15MISOWCAG21RatioV14requirementsAASb7textual_Sb10nonTextualtvp","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"requirementsAA"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:15MISOFoundations18WCAG21Requirementsa","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"WCAG21Requirements"}]},"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/MISOFoundations\/documentation\/MISOFoundations","doc:\/\/MISOFoundations\/documentation\/MISOFoundations\/MISOWCAG21Ratio"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"requirementsAA"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:15MISOFoundations18WCAG21Requirementsa","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOFoundations\/documentation\/MISOFoundations\/WCAG21Requirements","text":"WCAG21Requirements"},{"kind":"text","text":" { "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"get"},{"kind":"text","text":" }"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"WCAG 2.1 requirement for AA level needs to have textual component matching 4.5:1 contrast ratio"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and non textual component matching 3:1 contrast ratio."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This is recommended for web projects."}],"references":{"doc://MISOFoundations/documentation/MISOFoundations/MISOWCAG21Ratio":{"kind":"s